# Scenario 02 i- least privilege + identity-scoped patterns.

# Any client may only touch the camera subtree matching its own client-id.
# camera connects with client-id "frontdoor" -> cam/frontdoor/#
pattern readwrite cam/%c/#

# Monitoring service: health topic and broker stats only. No camera access.
user svc_health
topic read health/#
topic read $SYS/#

# Home Assistant: own namespace. Reads only camera EVENTS, never config.
user svc_ha
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite home/lab/#
topic read cam/+/events
